## Summary
Soongsil University's G-LAMP project team has signed a Memorandum of Understanding with Cedars-Sinai Medical Center in the United States. The agreement focuses on collaborative research in the fusion of artificial intelligence and biological sciences. This partnership aims to advance interdisciplinary studies in medical technology and bioinformatics.

## Key Points
- Soongsil University's G-LAMP team initiates MOU with Cedars-Sinai Medical Center
- Collaboration centers on AI and bio-convergence research
- Formal agreement to promote interdisciplinary medical research
- Potential advancements in medical technology and bioinformatics


